# dim T_1 <= 25 - r for EVERY member of a parametrised family, via minors (reg2 round 4).
# The FO equations are linear in t = (x, r): coefficient matrix A(params) (rows = y-monomials, 25 columns).  rank A >= r everywhere on the
# family  <=  the ideal generated by K chosen r x r minors (+ the family relations) is the unit ideal over Q (Singular).  Exact, no charts in t.
# usage: gen_rank.py FAMILY r K SEED          families defined below (params, basis, relations)
